<title>USA: UPS, TEAMSTERS TALKS TO START 0900 EDT THURSDAY.</title>
<headline>UPS, TEAMSTERS TALKS TO START 0900 EDT THURSDAY.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>A spokesman for the Federal Mediation and Conciliation Service said talks between the striking Teamsters union and United Parcel Service would begin at 9 a.m. EDT (1300 GMT) on Thursday.</p>
</text>
